{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"story_reckpr_set_1_story_1","storyGroup":"story_reckpr_set_1","storySort":0,"storyDependence":null,"storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":null,"storyName":"何须剑","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"云青萍救下了一位欲复仇的老人，并成了那位古稀老人的师父。“仇恨”还是“豁达”，用言语说不清的道理又如何用武功来言说？","storyCanEnter":0,"storyTxt":"obt/memory/story_reckpr_1_1","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":0,"requiredStages":null,"characters":["受伤的老人","云青萍","陈锈清","童年云青萍","玉门军医","重岳","少年云青萍"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"showall","id":5},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":6},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":7,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":9},{"type":"subtitle","text":"痛，断骨之痛。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":10},{"type":"subtitle","text":"那一击正中他的胸膛。他最后的记忆，是向崖底坠落，是死到临头还不服，是深刻的耻辱。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":11},{"type":"subtitle","text":"他在哪儿？已经死了？还是......","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":12},{"type":"subtitle","text":"崖底的地面竟如此柔软......？","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":13},{"type":"subtitle","id":14},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":15},{"type":"dialog","id":16},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":17},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":18},{"type":"charslot","id":19},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":20},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":21},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":22},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":23},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"呃......","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"这是......哪儿？","id":25},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"（低头看包扎过的伤口）","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"我竟然得人相救，没有死......","id":27},{"type":"dialog","id":28},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_cloakmovement","volume":"1","id":29},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":30},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":31},{"type":"charslot","id":32},{"type":"text","text":"受伤的老人挣扎下床，抓起自己的剑。","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"他四下寻找，想要向屋子的主人答谢救命之恩。环视一圈，只见屋中朴素干净，简帙齐整，此屋主想必是极为认真之人。","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"桌上摊开着一本笔记，老人被其笔法吸引，不由上前翻看。","id":35},{"type":"dialog","id":36},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":37},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":38},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":39},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"好稳的笔法。此人笔锋竟看不出一丝虚浮，如非书法家，定是位沉淀了数十年的高手。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"......《问武》——“十载录遍天下武，更觉意邈不知处。”","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":42},{"type":"charslot","id":43},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":44},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":45},{"type":"text","text":"老人翻了一页，花白的胡子顿时翘起。","id":46},{"type":"text","text":"那是一些精准的人体画，画的场面他这辈子都不会忘记——正是他被仇敌击下山崖的那场对决！","id":47},{"type":"text","text":"画旁的注解尖锐地指出了他应对那一记阴招的失策，甚至给出了一个堪称精妙的解法。老人顿觉脸红脑热，一口气压抑在胸口不得纾解。","id":48},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":50},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":51},{"type":"charslot","id":52},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":53},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":54},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":55},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":56},{"type":"text","text":"老人扶着墙快步而出。只见屋外一条小河，河上悬一条麻绳，麻绳上一位年轻人正迎面走来，而麻绳不曾晃动。","id":57},{"type":"text","text":"那年轻人背着手，提着菜，习以为常地走过麻绳，仿佛这只是他日常锻炼的一环。年轻人见了老人，便向他走来，显然是此间屋主。","id":58},{"type":"dialog","id":59},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_footstep_stonestep","volume":"0.6","channel":"step","loop":"false","id":60},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"step","fadetime":"2","id":61},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","duration":"1","id":62},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":63},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"您醒了，老前辈，身体感觉怎么样？","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":66},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"你......和那畜生是什么关系！","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"您是不是误会了？我与您素不相识，我是在进山散步时看到了从山崖上掉下来的您，见您昏迷不醒，这才把您带回来的。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":71},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"你说谎，我与那畜生对决的时候你明明就在场！","id":72,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":73},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"啊，您是说我在录武簿上记的招式？抱歉，我冒昧地推测了当时的情形......","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":75},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"推测？！","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":77},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"您手上的剑茧，纤长的手臂肌肉和发达的跟腱，还有剑上的使用痕迹都会告诉我您使用招式的习惯，再结合您身上的伤即可知晓大概。","id":78,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"我曾在军中录武多年，不过是些雕虫小技。","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":80},{"type":"dialogue","name":"受伤的老人","text":"......这么说来，是我误会了你？","id":81,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":82},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"咳咳......对不住了。老朽陈锈清，是山上那间剑馆的主人。不知恩人如何称呼？","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"晚辈姓云，名青萍，是工作之余，出来游历修心的。","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"修心，嗯......只不过，年轻人若是沉迷于纸上谈兵，怕是要耽误了真正的修行。你需知道，你写的应对之招，只在纸面上可行。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈了解自己的剑，说得自然没错。挥出那一剑时人的重心已偏移，再加上剑本身的重量，是不可能刺到咽喉的位置的。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"然而，要使您的剑锋恰好落在要害处，也只需做一个小改变。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":91},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"呵！你说说，我要做什么改变？","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈所使的剑外形奇特，剑尖比一般的剑更重。您或已习惯，并未觉不妥，但试试看，将食指勾到剑格上呢？","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"异想天开！你以为用剑的手势是这么容易改变的吗？！","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":97},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"需要数年，甚至十数年的练习。我只告诉您可行性，做不做由您自己决定。","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":99},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"0.6","id":102},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","id":103},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":104},{"type":"text","text":"陈锈清一脸狐疑，却又思索着走开了。片刻，屋后传来舞剑声。","id":105},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swrdclave","volume":"0.4","id":107},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_swordwhoosh","volume":"0.6","delay":"1","id":108},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_thinsword_whoosh","volume":"0.7","delay":"1.8","id":109},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":110},{"type":"text","text":"舞剑声停，旋即又响，再停，似是那人在仔细琢磨。突然，只见他提着剑跌跌撞撞地走过来。","id":111},{"type":"dialog","id":112},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":113},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"你怎知可行？","id":114,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":115},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"剑的重心只改变了一毫，但许多对决，差的只是那一毫。","id":116,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":117},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"你如此年纪，受不住......也给我受着！","id":118,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":119},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_kneelsnow_s","volume":"1","id":120},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":121},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":122},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"这一拜，为救命之恩！","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"啊......？","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"charslot","id":127},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"而这一拜......","id":128},{"type":"text","text":"陈锈清梗着脖子，好似逼着自己低头，挣扎许久，发出悲痛一叹，终于又低头一拜。","id":129},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"请收我这老剑客为徒！","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#4$1","focus":"m","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"......啊？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EC/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":133},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":134},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":135},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":136},{"type":"charslot","id":137},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":138},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":139},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_normal_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":140,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":142},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":143},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈，何必跟着我过来。河边潮湿，对伤不好。拜师之事，也请不要再提，已与您解释了很多遍，我不过行录武之事，怎敢自称为师？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"我在这里看了你半天，你在干什么？","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":147},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"捉鳞，也观鳞。鳞水一体，以眼观心......","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":149},{"type":"multiline","name":"陈锈清","text":"啊——","id":150},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":151},{"type":"multiline","name":"陈锈清","text":"嗬！","id":152},{"type":"dialog","id":153},{"type":"charslot","id":154},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_watermagic_2","volume":"0.7","id":155},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"早说嘛！都浮上来了，我去给您捞。年轻......师父，您要几条？","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":159},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"......","id":160,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":161},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":162},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":163},{"type":"charslot","id":164},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":165},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":166},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":167},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":169},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈......我这块田间的杂草......都去了哪里？您的伤势又如何了？","id":170,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":171},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"哈哈哈！年轻人果然还是爱偷懒啊。不用谢，帮您把杂草都清了，水也挑来了。我这把老骨头硬朗得很，还有什么要做的，尽管开口！","id":172,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":173},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"......","id":174,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":175},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈，您坐，我们聊聊吧。","id":176,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":177},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","volume":"0.7","id":178},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.7","id":179},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":180},{"type":"text","text":"云青萍默默放下卷起的衣袖，不得不放弃了锄草锻炼身体的计划。他坐在光秃秃的田里叹了口气，问出了那个之前故意不提的问题——","id":181},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":182},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":183},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈您......为何定要拜我为师？","id":184,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":185},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"唉。啧......唉！那我也坦白与你说吧。士可杀不可辱，我有仇要报。","id":186,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"我遭我信任的徒儿背叛。我对那畜生倾囊相授，他却为了五斗米折腰，毁我剑馆名声，就为了逼我将那块地皮卖他。","id":187,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"我要是再年轻二十年，不，十年，哪还轮得到那畜生对我出手！","id":188,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":189},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈提升了剑法，又将如何？","id":190,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":191},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"不管他使没使阴招，败在他手下便是我陈某技不如人，我认了！","id":192,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"然而，此仇不报，我怎咽得下这口气，又怎么在江湖上立足？！","id":193,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":194},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"......老前辈想跟我学的，是复仇剑法。我恐怕......","id":195,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":196},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1.5","id":197},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":199},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_bg_bg_light.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":201},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7A/Avg_bg_bg_indoor.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1.5","id":202},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"1.5","keep":"true","initamount":"0","amount":"1","block":"true","id":203},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":204,"musicid":2},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"呜......","id":206},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1640_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":207},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"来，孩子，药里加了止疼剂，喝完后就不会疼了。","id":208,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"还有，这病房里平时只有我，不用总是咬牙忍痛的。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"（喝下苦药）","id":212},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1640_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":213},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"真是勇敢的孩子。睡吧，好好睡觉，才能好起来。","id":214,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"大夫......我的父母都被歹人害死了，从此以后，只有我一人了......","id":217},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1640_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":218},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"我听说了，你试着用一把剑救你的父母，却被歹人击落到田埂里......你一直撑到了宗师找到你，坚强的孩子。","id":219,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":220},{"type":"charslot","id":221},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"我以后，须得自己照顾自己了......关于我的伤，您能不能......对我说实话，我真的还能好起来吗？","id":222},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1640_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":223},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"当然......大概率。","id":224,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":225},{"type":"charslot","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"嗯......好起来以后，我会怎么样呢？","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1640_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"唉......好吧。你可放心，你的伤不致命，好起来以后应该还能站起来。","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":230},{"type":"charslot","id":231},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"......嗯。","id":232},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1640_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":233},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"......但即便能走动，体质也会比常人弱。你今后要把身体当作雨中的沙堡一样保护。对常人无害的运动、碰撞，都可能使沙堡坍塌。","id":234,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":235},{"type":"charslot","id":236},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"嗯。多谢......您的实话。","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"......","id":238},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"（咬牙忍住）（无声地啜泣起来）","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"......本来都好好的......他们来之前，都还好好的......","id":240},{"type":"dialog","id":241},{"type":"charslot","id":242},{"type":"text","text":"孩童用他那无力的拳头捶着床，发泄着愤恨，一下又一下，纱布重新染血，而他似不觉痛。","id":243},{"type":"text","text":"军医无言，在承担悲惨命运的人面前，旁人的任何语言都是苍白的。","id":244},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1640_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"玉门军医","text":"......啊，你听外面的声音，是宗师带兵回来了。我听说他们俘虏了袭击你家人的那一窝歹人。","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_npc_1640_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":247},{"type":"charslot","id":248},{"type":"text","text":"云青萍顿时挣扎着要坐起来。看到他愤怒的目光，军医不禁上前扶住他，想助他亲眼看到仇敌伏法。","id":249},{"type":"text","text":"然而，当他真的勉强坐起时，他似又想到了什么，犹豫再三后，缓缓扭过头，对着墙。","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"童年云青萍","text":"不。我不要看......如果这伤要疼一辈子......我不要每次疼的时候，都想起他们的脸。","id":251},{"type":"dialog","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"charslot","id":255},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_bg_bg_black.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","fadetime":"0.5","keep":"true","initamount":"1","amount":"0","id":257},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":258},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":259},{"type":"subtitle","text":"我不是放下了仇恨，我是......放过了我自己。","x":"300","y":"370","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":260},{"type":"subtitle","id":261},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":262},{"type":"dialog","id":263},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DD/Avg_bg_bg_light.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":264},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":265},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":266},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":267},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":268},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"小师父？","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":271},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈？是......我说梦话惊扰了您？","id":272,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":273},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"谁没一两段不想说的往事，我什么都没听见。","id":274,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":275},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"......往事不可复，但求来者犹可追。","id":276,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":277},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"嘟囔什么呢，没事的话我继续去睡了啊。","id":278,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":279},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈既然非要喊我一声师父，我就斗胆应了吧，只是您需答应我一件事——","id":280,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"您说您说！","id":282,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":283},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"习剑期间，不可拿起您那把剑。","id":284,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":285},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"什么，习剑不用剑？！我教人剑法教了一辈子，我——","id":286,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":287},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"您现在，姑且是我的学生。","id":288,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":289},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"嘶——","id":290,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":291},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":292},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":294},{"type":"charslot","id":295},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":298,"musicid":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"修习第一日","id":301},{"type":"dialog","id":302},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":303},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈，腰，第三次了。","id":304,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":305},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"（一脸不服地收腰）为了报仇......","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"唉，腰一动，腿的动作就不对了。","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/36/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"（额角青筋暴突）忍了......！","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":311},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"“剑尖”下坠了。重新计时吧。","id":312,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":313},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"这就是根棍儿......","id":314,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":315},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"心中有剑，何必在意剑形——腿，又不对了。重新计时。","id":316,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":317},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"又重新？！你这人，说话软绵绵的，手段怎么这么狠！这一套都跟谁学的？！","id":318,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":319},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"武学这许多道理，统统是跟我的老师——","id":320,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":321},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"我说这些折磨人的法子！","id":322,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"意形一体，同宗同源。","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"唉！看来，在那位不讲道理的老师手下，你可没少吃苦头！","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"我知道老前辈说的是玩笑话。不过，我的老师的确从不“讲”道理。毕竟，越是重要的道理，越没法“讲”明白。","id":328,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"他都是让我，自己从武学里去悟的——","id":329,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":330},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":331},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":332},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":333},{"type":"charslot","id":334},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_35_g8_yumenarena.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":335},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","id":337},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#2$1","id":338},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":339},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":340,"musicid":4},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":341},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":343},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"青萍，腰，挺直。借腰之力将剑向前送。","id":344,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"......","id":346,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"气息又乱了。需要休息了吗？","id":348,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":349},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"不，我还能坚持的。老师叫我来参与操练，我本该感激不尽。","id":350,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/00/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#7$1","focus":"r","id":351},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"......","id":352,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":353},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"你的心中，可有疑问？","id":354,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":355},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"是，有。老师难道不觉得，我这样的人，站在这演武场上显得格格不入？","id":356,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"别人挥舞着大刀巨斧，老师却只叫我举着一根小树枝作剑。别人对着木人大削大砍，我却只需要用这根又轻又小的枯枝戳这块大石头......","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"固然，我的手能举起的只有区区一根枯枝，但这枯枝脆弱不堪，稍一用力，便会被折断，被捏成齑粉。","id":358,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"老师却要我用一根枯枝推动这块比我的腰还高的石头。我日日在此处，仅练习这一件事......何尝不是在做无用功？","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"我如何能寄希望于用一根枯枝去推动巨石？","id":361,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/CC/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#10$1","focus":"l","id":362},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"我本该早些与你说清。我教你的时候，可曾有怠慢？","id":363,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7D/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":364},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"不，未曾有。","id":365,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AE/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":366},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"老师的意思是......您是真的相信，我做得到？","id":367,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/04/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_2024_chyue_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":368},{"type":"dialogue","name":"重岳","text":"水行石上，风过山岗，何曾有事物能挡了它们的道？","id":369,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/97/Avg_avg_2024_chyue_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_791_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":370},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"水行石上，风过山岗......可是，究竟......","id":371,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"charslot","id":375},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_35_g8_yumenarena.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":376},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#7$1","id":377},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":378},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":379},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":380},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":381},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"我明白了。水行石上，而非与石头硬碰硬。推动这块石头，用的一定是柔劲。","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"我以腿带腰，以腰带臂......啊。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"charslot","id":385},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_branchrupture","volume":"0.7","id":386},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":387},{"type":"dialog","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":390},{"type":"charslot","id":391},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_35_g8_yumenarena.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":392},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#2$1","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":396},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":397},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"风过山岗，老师的意思一定是，须使出轻盈的巧劲。","id":398,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"少年云青萍","text":"气沉丹田，观其弱点......","id":399},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":400},{"type":"multiline","name":"少年云青萍","text":"啊！嘶......手指撞肿了......","id":401},{"type":"dialog","id":402},{"type":"charslot","id":403},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_branchrupture","volume":"0.7","id":404},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":405},{"type":"dialog","id":406},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":408},{"type":"charslot","id":409},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_35_g8_yumenarena.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":410},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":411},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":412},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":413},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_branchrupture","volume":"0.7","id":414},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":415},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":416},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"断了......","id":417,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":418},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":419},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":420},{"type":"charslot","id":421},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/2D/Avg_bg_35_g8_yumenarena.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":422},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":423},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.7","block":"true","id":424},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":425},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_branchrupture","volume":"0.7","id":426},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":427},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":428},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"又断了！","id":429,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AB/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp3","volume":"1","id":430},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":431},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#6$1","focus":"m","id":432},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"三个月了......这枯槁老木！这......冥顽不化的石头！这......不争气的胳膊！该死的强盗！","id":433,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AB/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"区区枯枝，痴心妄想！","id":434,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/AB/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#5$1","focus":"m","id":435},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"（啜泣）","id":436,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/53/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":437},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","id":438},{"type":"delay","time":"0.7","id":439},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_rain","layer":"1","id":440},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainheavy_loop","loop":"true","channel":"bgs","volume":"0","id":441},{"type":"soundvolume","channel":"bgs","volume":"0.8","fadetime":"2","id":442},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":443},{"type":"text","text":"天公不作美，雨点不留情。少年冷静下来，抹抹眼泪，迎着雨又拾了一根枯枝，走向那块与他较劲了三个月而不为所动的大石头。","id":444},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":445},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"下盘，腰，手。借腰之力，向前送——","id":446,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":447},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"......","id":448,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#2$1","focus":"m","id":449},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"下盘，腰，手。推。","id":450,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_791_1#7$1","focus":"m","id":451},{"type":"dialogue","name":"少年云青萍","text":"......","id":452,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/20/Avg_avg_npc_791_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":453},{"type":"charslot","id":454},{"type":"text","text":"雨，越来越大。少年听着雨声，内心不知何时平静了下来。他如往常那般专注于自身，并未注意到积水已没过他的鞋底。","id":455},{"type":"text","text":"被水浸湿的泥土踩上去感觉很陌生，枯枝的手感也略有不同。他在雨中体会着这一切。","id":456},{"type":"text","text":"水行石上，润其下土。借力而发，力到——","id":457},{"type":"text","text":"石移。","id":458},{"type":"text","text":"少年睁开了眼。就在刚才，这块磐石因他动了几不可察的一分。他抬头，迎着无边际的天、吞山河的雨。他笑这块石头也没那么了不起。","id":459},{"type":"dialog","id":460},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":461},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"bgs","fadetime":"2","id":462},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":463},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":464},{"type":"charslot","id":465},{"type":"bgeffect","id":466},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":467},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":468},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":469},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$path_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/a001/m_dia_path_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":470,"musicid":5},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":471},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":472},{"type":"text","text":"修习一月后","id":473},{"type":"dialog","id":474},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":475},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈的技法已入新境。明日起，将棍棒换回您的剑吧。","id":476,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"起先您总是打磨那把剑，这几日却未曾见您照料它了。今晚，不如就将它拿出来......","id":477,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":478},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"不必，我继续用这根棍，顺手。","id":479,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#10$1","focus":"m","id":480},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"可是，您的手最终要与剑同步同调......","id":481,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9D/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":482},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"先打磨杀性，着眼剑法本身——你起初叫我丢开那把剑，不是这个意思？我乐意再打磨打磨，你不必管。","id":483,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":484},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"好。","id":485,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":486},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":487},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":488},{"type":"charslot","id":489},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/70/Avg_bg_bg_forest.png","screenadapt":"coverall","block":"true","id":490},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":491},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":492},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":493},{"type":"text","text":"修习数月后","id":494},{"type":"dialog","id":495},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":496},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"又在观鳞。腾出位置做什么，我不爱看。","id":497,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":498},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"您看腻了。","id":499,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":500},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"流水载鳞，千变万化，当我知道你在河边看些什么的时候，我都看醉了，又怎么会看腻？","id":501,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"只不过每次看入了神，那每一片树叶的颤动，每一丝河水的涟漪，天地万物，都往我老眼里钻，太费神了。","id":502,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"真佩服你，看得这么专注，却还这么平心静气。师父到底是师父，我还差得远。","id":503,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":504},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"老前辈，可否为我捞一尾鳞来？","id":505,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":506},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"这有何难？","id":507,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":508},{"type":"charslot","id":509},{"type":"text","text":"那位老人说着，却并未一掌劈向水面，而是跪坐下来，仔细观察起水流。云青萍微笑起来。","id":510},{"type":"text","text":"以水观鳞，知鳞之所向。顺流轻触——鳞轻轻跃入云青萍身侧的桶中。","id":511},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#9$1","focus":"m","id":512},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"（抚掌）老前辈——这一尾鳞，便是我们的告别礼。今日起，我已没有东西可以教您了。","id":513,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FD/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4196_reckpr_1#8$1","focus":"m","id":514},{"type":"dialogue","name":"云青萍","text":"修心治身，接下来的路，谁都教不得，得您自己走。我离开自小长大的地方时，我的老师也是这么对我说的。","id":515,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/57/Avg_avg_4196_reckpr_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1639_1#1$1","focus":"m","id":516},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"......修心，治身。好，好。","id":517,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"陈锈清","text":"那么，此番别去，可就江湖不见了。","id":518,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/49/Avg_avg_npc_1639_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":519},{"type":"charslot","id":520},{"type":"text","text":"云青萍听后并不意外，向他颔首笑着致意。老人向云青萍长长一揖，隐隐已有超然之风。","id":521},{"type":"text","text":"他朗笑而去，走入深林不见了踪影。平时充斥着习武声的屋子，如今已空荡荡。","id":522},{"type":"text","text":"屋主安坐片刻，便也起身，带了为数不多的几样东西，再次踏上了四处游历之路。只留了一把老剑，倚在斜阳里。","id":523},{"type":"dialog","id":524},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":525},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":526},{"type":"charslot","id":527},{"type":"image","id":528}],"characters":["受伤的老人","云青萍","陈锈清","童年云青萍","玉门军医","重岳","少年云青萍"]}